{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "空の図鑑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sky Atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空の色と、起きた朝のできごとで、ページが埋まっていきます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pages fill in with the colors of the sky and the mornings you get up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは見本の図鑑です。最初の空を撮ると、あなたの図鑑になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a sample atlas. Take your first sky to make it yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "めずらしい空・まぼろしの空 18 ページは Pro の図鑑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "18 rare and mythic pages are in the Pro atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skies"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "朝のできごと": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mornings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見つけ方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to find it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最初に見つけた朝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この空の朝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mornings with this sky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro の図鑑をひらく": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Pro atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラの許可がありません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NO CAMERA ACCESS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空を撮るには、カメラをオンに": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the camera to catch the sky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定 › あさやけ図鑑 › カメラ をオンにしてください。写真は色を読むためだけに使い、この iPhone の外には送りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to Settings › Dawn Atlas › Camera and switch it on. Photos are only used to read colors and never leave this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定を開く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末ではカメラが使えません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NO CAMERA ON THIS DEVICE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見本の空で試す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try a sample sky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空の色が図鑑に入るまでを、見本の写真で試せます。見本は記録には入りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See how a sky becomes an atlas page using a sample photo. Samples are not saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見本の空なので、記録には入りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This was a sample sky, so it isn’t saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パレットに置く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to palette"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新しいページ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NEW PAGE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "めずらしい空は Pro の図鑑に残せます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep rare skies in the Pro atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新しい": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NEW"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "続けた朝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Streak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最初の 1 枚は試しです。明日の朝、起きて 15 分以内に撮ると、続けた朝が始まります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first shot is a trial. Tomorrow, shoot within 15 minutes of waking to start your streak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空のメモ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SKY NOTE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あさやけ図鑑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dawn Atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "図鑑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Atlas"
