      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の空は、もう図鑑に入っています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today’s sky is already in your atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ夜です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It’s still night"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日の朝は過ぎました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This morning has passed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "色が読めませんでした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t read the colors"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最初の 1 枚は、今すぐ試し撮りできます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can take a trial shot right now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "窓が開いています。カーテンを開けて、空を": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your window is open. Open the curtains and look up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寝坊の朝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A late morning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空を撮る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catch the sky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今朝の空": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "THIS MORNING"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いちばん長く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Best"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見本": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SAMPLE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前の月": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Previous month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次の月": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これは見本です。明日の朝、起きて 15 分以内に空を撮ると、ここに今朝の色が入ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a sample. Tomorrow, shoot the sky within 15 minutes of waking and your morning’s color lands here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今月の空のパレットを共有": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share this month’s palette"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "窓の中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "早起き": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Early"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寝坊": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Late"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "撮らなかった": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Missed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年の輪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YEAR RING"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "くわしい振り返りと、1 年のポスター": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deeper insights and a year poster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平均の起きた時刻・曜日ごとの強さ・季節の色（Pro）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Average wake time, best weekdays, seasonal colors (Pro)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この 30 日の平均": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last 30 days, on average"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "曜日ごとの、窓の中で起きた割合": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How often you hit the window, by weekday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年のポスターを書き出す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export a year poster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真と記録は、この iPhone の中だけに保存されます。送信しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos and records stay on this iPhone. Nothing is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次へ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起きてからの 15 分が、空の図鑑になる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first 15 minutes awake become a sky atlas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起きると決めた時刻から 15 分以内に空を撮ると、その朝の空の色が 1 マスになって、今月のパレットと図鑑に入ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shoot the sky within 15 minutes of your wake time, and that morning’s color becomes a square in this month’s palette and a page in your atlas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寝坊した朝は、マスが欠ける": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep in, and the square chips"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "罰はありません。欠けたマスが見えるだけ。めずらしい空は、早起きした朝にしか出会えません。図鑑は 48 ページ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No penalties — you just see a chipped square. Rare skies only show up on mornings you’re up early. 48 pages to collect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起きる時刻を決める": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set your wake time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "曜日ごとの時刻は、あとで設定から変えられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can set different times per weekday later in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真は色を読むためだけに使い、この iPhone の外には送りません。ログインも広告もありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos are only used to read colors and never leave this iPhone. No login, no ads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "朝を、1 年ぶんの絵に": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn a year of mornings into art"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あさやけ図鑑 Pro は 1 回だけの買い切りです。サブスクではありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dawn Atlas Pro is a one-time purchase. Not a subscription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "めずらしい空 18 ページ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "18 rare sky pages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "燃える空・星の残る空・地平の光・夏至や冬至の朝・三十日目の朝など。見つけた空を図鑑に残せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burning Sky, Lingering Stars, Horizon Glow, solstice mornings, your thirtieth morning and more — kept in your atlas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年のポスター": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Year poster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年の輪と、最近 30 朝の帯を、きれいな 1 枚に書き出せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export your year ring or your last 30 mornings as a clean, shareable image."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "くわしい振り返り": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deeper insights"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この 30 日の平均の起きた時刻、曜日ごとの強さ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Average wake time over 30 days and your strongest weekdays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "休む日": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体調の悪い日や旅行の日に。続けた朝を途切れさせません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For sick days and trips. Your streak stays intact."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空を撮る・今月のパレット・1 年の輪・図鑑の 30 ページ・今月のパレットの共有は、ずっと無料です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catching the sky, the monthly palette, the year ring, 30 atlas pages and sharing your monthly palette are free forever."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "購入を復元": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore Purchases"
          }
        }
      }
    },
