      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Different time per weekday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "毎日": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起きる時刻から 15 分が「窓」です。窓の中で空を撮ると、マスが埋まります。2 時間前から撮れば早起きの印がつきます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your “window” is the 15 minutes after your wake time. Shoot inside it to fill the square. Shoot up to 2 hours early for an early-bird mark."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お知らせ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NOTIFICATIONS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "起きる時刻にお知らせする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notify me at wake time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末の中だけで予約するお知らせです。目覚ましの代わりではありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scheduled on this device only. Not a replacement for an alarm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PHOTOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "撮った写真を小さく残す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep small copies of photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オフにすると、写真は色を読んだらすぐに捨て、色だけを残します。写真も色も、この iPhone の外には送りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, photos are discarded right after the colors are read; only the colors are kept. Nothing ever leaves this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残した写真をすべて消す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete all saved photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "休む日（Pro）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "REST DAYS (PRO)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日を休む日にする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make today a rest day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "休むのをやめる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undo rest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "休む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体調の悪い日や旅行の日。続けた朝を途切れさせず、マスには月のしるしが入ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For sick days or travel. Your streak won’t break, and the square gets a moon mark."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手ざわり": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FEEL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "振動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haptics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音は鳴らしません。朝は家族が寝ていることが多いためです。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sounds — others are often still asleep in the morning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのほか": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OTHER"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使い方をもう一度見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show the intro again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写真と記録は、この iPhone の中（アプリの中）だけに保存されます。サーバー・ログイン・広告・解析はありません。アプリを消すと、記録も消えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos and records are stored only inside this app on this iPhone. No servers, login, ads or analytics. Deleting the app deletes your records."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残した写真をすべて消しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete all saved photos?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "消す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空の色とマスは残ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your sky colors and squares will stay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今月のパレット": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "朝の帯": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見本のパレットです。空を撮ると、あなたの色になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a sample palette. Catch the sky to make it yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
